  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fldtteam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/ldtteam/public-asset-storage/blob/version/latest/image.png?raw=true\" width=\"2913\" height=\"1458\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.minecolonies.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/139070364159311872/widget.png?style=banner2\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Minecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/ldtteam/public-asset-storage/blob/version/latest/patreon-img.png?raw=true\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1200\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rDNMBiT.png\" width=\"860\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>隆重推出 MineColonies 的迷人擴充套件：引人入勝的 TownTalk 附加模組！沉浸在一個嶄新的世界中，透過生動且具沉浸感的語音互動，讓你的殖民者煥然一新、充滿鮮明的個性。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>看著你的村莊在工人們愉悅的閒聊聲中繁榮興盛，每位工人都有獨特的台詞，為遊戲體驗增添全新的深度層次。</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>從歡快的問候到富有見地的評論，此附加模組為你的殖民地注入活力，在你與勤勉的居民之間締結牢不可破的連結。</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>配音員：<br>- Elle Ray James</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- ShallowVA</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- ItBeMeMrButts</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>-&nbsp;Tabsers</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- Sammieqt_</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>-&nbsp;Andrew LaRiviere</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>-&nbsp;Jodi Hansen</strong></span></p>",
